Deen e islam ko karbal mein bachatay hai hussain,<br>
istarha wada e tiflee ko nibhatay hai hussain.<br>
<br>
1. apni aulad fida kar ke baqa e deen par,<br>
kufr ka naam zamane se mitatay hai hussain.<br>
<br>
2. nazr kartey huway qaleq ko shahadath ke gulab,<br>
ek beyaban ko qulistan banatay hai hussain.<br>
<br>
3. aao aiyub zara sabr ke jauhar dekho,<br>
sabr ki shaan hai kya aaj batatay hai hussain.<br>
<br>
4.dekh kar qaimay ke dar se ye kaha fizza na,<br>
lash nausha ki maidan se laatay hai hussain.<br>
<br>
5. hai qayamath ka sama koi madadgar nahi,<br>
hai laasha ali akbar ka uthatay hai hussain.<br>
<br>
6.haal besheer ka kistarha batau maa ko,<br>
ran se qaiyme ko yahi sochtay jatay hai hussain.<br>
<br>
7. maa khadi dekh rahi hai yeh dareh qayme se,<br>
qabr maidaan mein asghar ki banatay hai hussain.<br>
<br>
8.jo uthatay hai alamdare jari kari parcham,<br>
usko har ranj o musibath se bachatay hai hussain.<br>
<br>
9.tazkera hota hai abbas e jari ka jisdam,<br>
saath shahzadi e kaunain ke aate hai hussain.<br>
<br>
10.rishta quraan ka itrat se nahi hoga juda,<br>
noke naiza se bhi quran sunatay hai hussain.<br>
<br>
11.jis ke dil mein bhi ziyarat ki tadap hai sahil,<br>
bilyaqeen karbobala usko bulatay hai hussain